IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P8-gate`
IMPORT `P8-art72`

-- Tests of Article 72. Expected values are written from the text and the dates of Art 113, before the run.
-- The group General applies from 2 August 2026; a system high-risk under Annex III and placed on the market on 2 December 2027
-- (the date Chapter III applies to it) is not saved by Art 111(2); placed on 1 January 2026 and unchanged it is saved.
-- Arguments of the system functions, in order: date asked, route, date placed, changed in design, then the facts.

`Art 72 test the Annex III route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
`Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` MEANS Date 2 12 2027
`Art 72 test a system placed earlier` MEANS Date 1 1 2026

§ `Art 72(1): the duty to establish and document`

-- before, on and after 2 August 2026 (one on each side of 27 July 2026 too): all facts true
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 1 1 2027) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- each element missing: established, documented, proportionate
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 111(2): placed earlier and unchanged is saved (NOTHING); significantly changed it is covered
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 1 1 2027) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed earlier` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 1 1 2027) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed earlier` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: the duty is for the high-risk AI system (silent)
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 1 1 2027) `Route neither` `Art 72 test a system placed earlier` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the other route (Annex I): Art 111(2) as amended saves a system placed before 2 August 2028, so a system placed on 2 December 2027 is saved unless changed
#ASSERT `Art 72(1) the provider has met the duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 1 1 2027) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- the regulative rule: no time limit, no consequence (no breach path); nothing owed before the group applies
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 72(1) the provider's duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party provider` DOES `Art 72(1) establish and document a post-market monitoring system` AT (Day (Date 20 8 2026))
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 72(1) the provider's duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 31 12 2030))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 72(1) the provider's duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE AT (Day (Date 1 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 31 12 2030))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 72(1) the provider's duty to establish and document a post-market monitoring system` (Date 1 1 2027) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed earlier` FALSE FALSE FALSE AT (Day (Date 1 1 2027)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 31 12 2030))

