§ `Art 72(3): the plan, and the Commission's template in both versions`

#ASSERT `Art 72(3) first and second sentences the post-market monitoring system is based on a plan that is part of the technical documentation` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) first and second sentences the post-market monitoring system is based on a plan that is part of the technical documentation` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) first and second sentences the post-market monitoring system is based on a plan that is part of the technical documentation` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) first and second sentences the post-market monitoring system is based on a plan that is part of the technical documentation` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) first and second sentences the post-market monitoring system is based on a plan that is part of the technical documentation` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route neither` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- the two texts of the third sentence, each through its own function (the as-enacted branch is dead through the dispatcher)
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) as enacted the date by which the Commission must adopt the implementing act with the template` EQUALS Date 2 2 2026
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) as amended the date by which the Commission must adopt the guidance including a template` EQUALS Date 2 9 2027
-- the dispatcher: NOTHING before the group applies (both sides of 27 July 2026 and 1 August 2026), the amended date from 2 August 2026
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) the date by which the Commission must adopt the template for the post-market monitoring plan` (Date 26 7 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) the date by which the Commission must adopt the template for the post-market monitoring plan` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) the date by which the Commission must adopt the template for the post-market monitoring plan` (Date 1 8 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) the date by which the Commission must adopt the template for the post-market monitoring plan` (Date 2 8 2026) EQUALS JUST (Date 2 9 2027)
#ASSERT `Art 72(3) the date by which the Commission must adopt the template for the post-market monitoring plan` (Date 1 1 2028) EQUALS JUST (Date 2 9 2027)

-- the provider's plan rule: no time limit
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 72(3) the provider's duty to base the post-market monitoring system on a plan` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 72 test the Annex III route` `Art 72 test a system placed on the date Chapter III applies` FALSE FALSE FALSE AT (Day (Date 2 8 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party provider` DOES `Art 72(3) base the post-market monitoring system on a post-market monitoring plan that is part of the technical documentation` AT (Day (Date 5 8 2026))

-- the Commission's duty, as amended: by 2 September 2027, counting from the Omnibus's entry into force
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 72(3) as amended the Commission's duty to adopt the guidance including a template` AT (Day (Date 27 7 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party Commission` DOES `Art 72(3) as amended adopt guidance, including a template, on the post-market monitoring plan` AT (Day (Date 2 9 2027))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 72(3) as amended the Commission's duty to adopt the guidance including a template` AT (Day (Date 27 7 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party Commission` DOES `Art 72(3) as amended adopt guidance, including a template, on the post-market monitoring plan` AT (Day (Date 3 9 2027))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 72(3) as amended the Commission's duty to adopt the guidance including a template` AT (Day (Date 27 7 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 3 9 2027))
-- the Commission's duty, as enacted: by 2 February 2026, counting from the Regulation's entry into force
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 72(3) as enacted the Commission's duty to adopt the implementing act with the template` AT (Day (Date 1 8 2024)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party Commission` DOES `Art 72(3) as enacted adopt the implementing act laying down the template and the list of elements of the post-market monitoring plan` AT (Day (Date 2 2 2026))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 72(3) as enacted the Commission's duty to adopt the implementing act with the template` AT (Day (Date 1 8 2024)) WITH
    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party Commission` DOES `Art 72(3) as enacted adopt the implementing act laying down the template and the list of elements of the post-market monitoring plan` AT (Day (Date 3 2 2026))
-- the dispatching rule: not applicable on 1 August 2026 (nothing owed even after a long wait); as amended from 2 August 2026
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 72(3) the Commission's duty to adopt the template for the post-market monitoring plan` (Date 1 8 2026) AT (Day (Date 27 7 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 1 1 2030))
-- EXPECT BREACH
